OL,3,GNEWSAMcLaren investment will tackle
OL,4,ANeets issue - minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cabinet minister has said carmaker
OL,7,FMcLaren's investment in its UK
OL,8,Ffacilities was a "huge opportunity" to
OL,9,Faddress the "Neets crisis" in Surrey.
OL,11,FThe car manufacturer has announced a
OL,12,F#500m investment in its UK facilities,
OL,13,Fincluding its Woking headquarters,
OL,14,Fwhich it says will create 1,000 jobs by
OL,15,F2032.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
