OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMcLaren investment will tackle
OL,4,ANeets issue - minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirst Secretary of State Louise Haigh
OL,7,Fsaid McLaren "and the kind of
OL,8,Fopportunities that it offers on
OL,9,Fpeople's doorstep in Woking" could help
OL,10,Fthe near one million UK young people
OL,11,Fnot in employment, education or
OL,12,Ftraining (Neet).
OL,14,FTheir plight became a national talking
OL,15,Fpoint after a government report warned
OL,16,Fof the "risk of a lost generation" in
OL,17,FMay.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
